  "borough": "Harrow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, by reason of the poor layout and relationship between Flat A and the private garden area allocated to Flat B, would result in an unacceptable level of overlooking, loss of privacy, security concerns and a compromised standard of residential amenity for future occupiers of the property. As such, the proposal fails to provide a satisfactory residential environment and is contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (20024), Policies D3. D(5), D3.D(7) and D3.D(10) and D6 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CS1 of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), and Policies DM1, DM2, DM26 and DM27 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013)."
  ],
